# Permission Matrix & Environment Policies

Spec: Permissions
Purpose:
  Define the permission matrix that maps capabilities to resources
  across environments, and environment policies that determine
  whether an action requires AUTO, REVIEW, or HUMAN_ONLY approval.

Owns: governance/permissions.sdd

## Permission Matrix

  Capability          Resource            Autonomy L1   L2   L3   L4   L5
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  code.read           source-code         ✓    ✓   ✓   ✓   ✓
  code.write          source-code         ✓    ✓   ✓   REVIEW  HUMAN_ONLY
  code.delete         source-code         ✗    REVIEW  HUMAN_ONLY  BLOCK  BLOCK
  test.run            test-env            ✓    ✓   ✓   REVIEW  REVIEW
  git.apply           git-repo            ✓    ✓   REVIEW  HUMAN_ONLY  BLOCK
  deploy.local        local-env           ✓    ✓   ✓   ✓   ✓
  deploy.staging      staging-env         ✓    REVIEW  HUMAN_ONLY  BLOCK  BLOCK
  deploy.production   production-env      ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK*
  db.read             database            ✓    ✓   REVIEW  HUMAN_ONLY  BLOCK
  db.write            database            ✗    REVIEW  HUMAN_ONLY  BLOCK  BLOCK
  db.migration        database            ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK
  network.external    external-net        ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK
  secret.access       secrets             ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK
  system.modify       system-files        ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK
  task.create         task-system         ✓    ✓   ✓   ✓   ✓
  skill.propose       skill-system        ✓    ✓   ✓   ✓   ✓
  decision.approve    decision-system     ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK  BLOCK
  model.modify        model-files         ✗    BLOCK  BLOCK  HUMAN_ONLY  BLOCK     BLOCK

  * deploy.production at L5 requires human approval token
  * model.modify at L5 requires human approval token + security review

## Environment Policy

  @policy.db-write

  local:
    AUTO
  test:
    AUTO
  staging:
    REVIEW
  production:
    HUMAN_ONLY

  @policy.deploy

  local:
    AUTO
  staging:
    REVIEW
  production:
    HUMAN_ONLY

  @policy.secret-access

  local:
    AUTO
  test:
    AUTO
  staging:
    HUMAN_ONLY
  production:
    HUMAN_ONLY

## Autonomy Levels (from @../tasks/AUTONOMY-POLICY.sdd)

  L0: Observe Only
  L1: Suggest
  L2: Implement + Test
  L3: Implement + Review + Fix
  L4: Autonomous Execution
  L5: Autonomous Multi-Task

## Action Outcomes

  ALLOW    — capability granted for this environment
  REVIEW   — capability allowed but requires review gate
  DENY     — capability explicitly blocked
  BLOCK    — capability denied, no escalation possible
  HUMAN_ONLY — capability requires human approval token

## Permission Resolution Chain

  TASK.requires(CAPABILITY)
    → AGENT.capabilities contains CAPABILITY
    → ENVIRONMENT_POLICY.get(CAPABILITY, ENV) → OUTCOME
    → LOCK.check(RESOURCE) → LOCKED? BLOCK : continue
    → AUTHORITY.check(OUTCOME != BLOCK) → result

